    "tpa_score_new": "<div>Attendance and participation: 20%, individual</div>\n\n<div>In-class exams (#1, #2, and #3 each worth 15%): 45%, individual</div>\n\n<div>Assignment 1 (Midterm): a brief analysis of a marketing case in textbook: 10%, group&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>Assignment 2 (Final term): a self-developed marketing case analysis: 25%, group</div>\n\n<div>Certification examinations and/or business competitions (each effort worth 5%): extra 10%</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>The maximum of semester grades: 92</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "1. 同學上課時應依老師引導、根據課程需要使用手機，禁止玩遊戲等非課程相關的使用行為。 \n2. 同學上課時須遵守課堂秩序，尊重他人上課權益。\n3. 未能到課者請依規定完成請假，缺曠課過多將影響學期成績。\n4. 以上規則適用實體及線上授課。",
